# Baseline manifest

What this project inherited from **engineering-baseline** (commit `{{ _copier_answers._commit or 'local' }}`),
how each asset is adopted, what it depends on, and the command that proves it works.

Paths are load-bearing: documents, skills and scripts refer to each other by relative path.
Keep every asset where it is unless this table says otherwise.

