| `docs/01-…/` to `docs/17-…/` | ratify: each document via the bootstrap | `docs/_template.md` | `node scripts/check.mjs` (status, markers) |
| `docs/04-adr/` | keep the rules; ADRs accumulate | `docs/04-adr/_template.md` | `node scripts/check.mjs` |
| `docs/13-technology/` | fill: one document per stack decision | ADRs | `node scripts/check.mjs` |
| `docs/DECISION-QUEUE.md` | maintain | — | review |
